    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 34 of Registration of Persons (Amendment) Act, No. 8 of 2016, I,S. B. Nawinna, Minister of Internal Affairs and Wayamba Development do by this Order, alter the date of expirationpublished in the Gazette No. 1979/40 of August 11, 2016 relating to the period of operation of Section 6, 9, 14, 16 and17 of the Registration of Persons Act, No. 32 of 1968 and every regulation made under the aforesaid Act (other than theRegistration of Persons Regulation 1990, published in the Gazette No. 637/6 of November, 20, 1990) to be 30.06.2019,until the necessary infrastructure, arrangements and technological methodologies are made to.",
